securecode debug

debugging and troubleshooting tools

Commands:
  securecode debug config        show resolved configuration
  securecode debug lsp           LSP debugging utilities
  securecode debug rg            ripgrep debugging utilities
  securecode debug file          file system debugging utilities
  securecode debug scrap         list all known projects
  securecode debug skill         list all available skills
  securecode debug snapshot      snapshot debugging utilities
  securecode debug startup       print startup timing
  securecode debug agent <name>  show agent configuration details
  securecode debug v2            debug v2 catalog and built-in plugins
  securecode debug info          show debug information
  securecode debug paths         show global paths (data, config, cache, state)
  securecode debug wait          wait indefinitely (for debugging)

Options:
  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]
      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure        run without external plugins                                           [boolean]"
`;

